From bca587411c720d3fc9ab89835e20fbf2dc43794c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Niccol=C3=B2=20Venerandi?= <niccolo@venerandi.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 15:20:17 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] appmenu: show the check marks of GTK apps when their menus
 open

GTK apps like LibreOffice only update check marks while a submenu's
submenu-action is set, which the proxy never did, and items becoming
checkable later were ignored. Now opening a menu sets it, and both work.

BUG: 399623
